IMPORT prelude

-- Health Practitioner Regulation National Law (Victoria) Act 2009 -- the dates, in one small module.
--
-- Built-in date functions only (DATE_FROM_DMY, DATE_SERIAL, DATE_FROM_SERIAL), not the daydate library. The Act counts
-- in plain days: "no more than 28 days after the person has been given notice" (s 6A(2)) and "no more than 28 days after
-- 1 July 2012" (s 9(2)). Its fixed days are 1 July 2010 (s 2, commencement) and 1 July 2012 (s 9).
--
